# Cartoon Jumping Ball Adventure

A small browser-based arcade game where a cheerful ball dashes through three cartoon-inspired worlds. Pick one of three characters, jump over wobbling obstacles, and enjoy playful sound effects every time you bounce.

## Playing the game

1. Open `index.html` in a modern desktop or mobile browser.
2. Choose a favorite character on the start screen, then press **Start Adventure**.
3. Tap or press the **space bar** to jump over obstacles.
4. Clear the target number of obstacles to advance through all three levels.
5. You have three lives—colliding with an obstacle costs one. Survive to the end to win!

The jump sound uses the Web Audio API, so your first interaction will unlock audio playback if your browser suspends it initially.
